{"rank": 93, "root": "بلغ", "form": 1, "lemma": "بَلَغَ", "count": 40, "ayahCount": 38, "share": 0.21, "meaning": {"bs": "dostići, doseći", "en": "to reach, to attain", "tr": "ulaşmak, erişmek", "fr": "atteindre, parvenir", "id": "mencapai, sampai", "ur": "پہنچنا، پا لینا", "bn": "পৌঁছানো, অর্জন করা", "fa": "رسیدن، دست یافتن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/22802388d9f442acd6ce.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-balagha_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes bls{from{transform:rotate(-24deg)}}@keyframes blt{from{transform:rotate(24deg)}}@keyframes blm{from{transform:translate(-66px,24px)}}.va-balagha_1 .ll,.va-balagha_1 .ra{transform:rotate(24deg);animation:bls .5s ease-in-out 5 alternate both}.va-balagha_1 .rl,.va-balagha_1 .la{transform:rotate(-24deg);animation:blt .5s ease-in-out 5 alternate both}.va-balagha_1 .fig{animation:blm 2.5s linear both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-balagha_1.off,.va-balagha_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-balagha_1,.va-balagha_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H18L84 37H114M104 37V16l9 4-9 4\"/><g transform=\"translate(84 20)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "بَلَغَ", "plain": "بَلَغَ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/22802388d9f442acd6ce.m4a", "recited": "audio/36c9f84c3f7a52205071.m4a", "recited